{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 11709191642862568132,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "LiteX",
      "source_hash": 8772627014255121608,
      "context_hash": 5432819109171586763,
      "translation": "LiteX",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206070Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV can be used with LiteX.",
      "source_hash": 4690337412358290062,
      "context_hash": 14948063813526149604,
      "translation": "FemtoRV는 LiteX와 함께 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206071Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[LiteX](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex) is an easy-to-use framework for creating SoCs.",
      "source_hash": 4573588659559321527,
      "context_hash": 1837758820692881395,
      "translation": "[LiteX](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex)는 SoC를 만들기 위한 사용하기 쉬운 프레임워크입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206071Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "it supports many different FPGA boards",
      "source_hash": 8746700688314673010,
      "context_hash": 15942531714850672718,
      "translation": "다양한 FPGA 보드를 지원합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206071Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "it includes gateware for many different devices (SDRAM, HDMI, SDCard, SATA ...)",
      "source_hash": 17870895792594247928,
      "context_hash": 17304498462023071067,
      "translation": "다양한 장치(SDRAM, HDMI, SDCard, SATA 등)를 위한 게이트웨어를 포함합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "it has basic software support (a BIOS)",
      "source_hash": 10774263039890432768,
      "context_hash": 3145265357650870661,
      "translation": "기본적인 소프트웨어 지원(BIOS)을 갖추고 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "with some cores (VexRiscV) it can even run Linux (not possible with FemtoRV though)",
      "source_hash": 7624223396696149672,
      "context_hash": 15385537658881712150,
      "translation": "일부 코어(VexRiscV)에서는 Linux까지 실행할 수 있습니다(다만 FemtoRV에서는 불가능합니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "The remainder of this file contains the instruction to install LiteX and its dependencies.",
      "source_hash": 1921480641275610189,
      "context_hash": 15011797782118550345,
      "translation": "이 파일의 나머지 부분에는 LiteX와 그 의존성을 설치하는 방법이 담겨 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Install open-source FPGA development toolchain",
      "source_hash": 5572138394935509058,
      "context_hash": 1228198625648871830,
      "translation": "오픈소스 FPGA 개발 툴체인 설치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Before starting, you will need to install the open-source FPGA development toolchain (Yosys, NextPNR etc...), instructions to do so are given [here](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/toolchain.md).",
      "source_hash": 7730992674601262402,
      "context_hash": 8340413545739898723,
      "translation": "시작하기 전에 오픈소스 FPGA 개발 툴체인(Yosys, NextPNR 등)을 설치해야 합니다. 설치 방법은 [여기](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/blob/master/FemtoRV/TUTORIALS/toolchain.md)에 나와 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FPGA": "FPGA"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Install LiteX",
      "source_hash": 16604640661599348158,
      "context_hash": 17042006156442707071,
      "translation": "LiteX 설치",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Follow setup instructions from [LiteX website](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex#quick-start-guide)",
      "source_hash": 13146235694704616123,
      "context_hash": 460225041094959502,
      "translation": "[LiteX 웹사이트](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex#quick-start-guide)의 설정 안내를 따르십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "*TL;DR*",
      "source_hash": 1618568810526966615,
      "context_hash": 9037523069556401161,
      "translation": "*요약*",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Synthesize",
      "source_hash": 4176728098668775770,
      "context_hash": 4352103704384737698,
      "translation": "합성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Instructions to synthesize are different, depending on the board you have.",
      "source_hash": 6963978763685190457,
      "context_hash": 13473378020485338038,
      "translation": "합성 방법은 보유한 보드에 따라 다릅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206072Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "[ULX3S](ULX3S.md)",
      "source_hash": 8987406757278611096,
      "context_hash": 17278649013713564284,
      "translation": "[ULX3S](ULX3S.md)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "[OrangeCrab](orange_crab.md)",
      "source_hash": 2410043028821409859,
      "context_hash": 14658776729791966144,
      "translation": "[OrangeCrab](orange_crab.md)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "[Other boards](litex-boards.md)",
      "source_hash": 2088148843754643488,
      "context_hash": 13653598565725870760,
      "translation": "[다른 보드](litex-boards.md)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Connect to the SoC",
      "source_hash": 492199891654164949,
      "context_hash": 6068307418161374803,
      "translation": "SoC에 연결하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Start a terminal emulator.",
      "source_hash": 1383384501699206255,
      "context_hash": 15750280298922341645,
      "translation": "터미널 에뮬레이터를 시작하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "You can use the one bundled with LiteX (lxterm).",
      "source_hash": 2474314545924545453,
      "context_hash": 11224179116085925901,
      "translation": "LiteX에 번들된 것(lxterm)을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "You will need to determine on which port it is plugged (one of `/dev/ttyUSBnnn`), use `$dmesg` right after plugging it (or try different values).",
      "source_hash": 11686193758191653745,
      "context_hash": 329682695827512624,
      "translation": "어느 포트에 연결되었는지(`/dev/ttyUSBnnn` 중 하나) 확인해야 합니다. 연결 직후 `$dmesg`를 사용하거나(또는 다른 값을 시도해 보십시오).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Supposing it is `ttyUSB0`, do:",
      "source_hash": 15568501853892323138,
      "context_hash": 4316750346269333248,
      "translation": "`ttyUSB0`이라고 가정하고 다음을 실행하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Then press `<enter>`.",
      "source_hash": 14258159904903108356,
      "context_hash": 11140601062732716842,
      "translation": "그런 다음 `<enter>`를 누르십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "You will see the `litex>` prompt.",
      "source_hash": 17842434742529124330,
      "context_hash": 8948604375356004548,
      "translation": "`litex>` 프롬프트가 나타날 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "As you may have guessed, do `litex> help` to see the possible commands.",
      "source_hash": 9632721708482834608,
      "context_hash": 13683276678416680264,
      "translation": "짐작하셨겠지만, 가능한 명령을 보려면 `litex> help`를 실행하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Try `litex> sdram_test`.",
      "source_hash": 5601049578163235570,
      "context_hash": 10627194931739541171,
      "translation": "`litex> sdram_test`를 실행해 보십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "If everything went well, it should say `Memtest OK`.",
      "source_hash": 1760918218121685448,
      "context_hash": 13085303120692924236,
      "translation": "모든 것이 정상적으로 진행되었다면 `Memtest OK`라고 표시될 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "To exit, press `<ctrl><\\>`",
      "source_hash": 8648457167176910107,
      "context_hash": 4351678951571234110,
      "translation": "종료하려면 `<ctrl><\\>`를 누르십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "FemtoRV variants",
      "source_hash": 1840589992615875443,
      "context_hash": 13318818757706888755,
      "translation": "FemtoRV 변형들",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206073Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "LiteX can use all the variants of FemtoRV, from the tiniest: femtorv-quark (RV32I) to the bigest one with an FPU: femtorv-petitbateau (RV32IMFC+irq).",
      "source_hash": 12428247419328741777,
      "context_hash": 8116286572728810773,
      "translation": "LiteX는 가장 작은 femtorv-quark(RV32I)부터 FPU가 있는 가장 큰 femtorv-petitbateau(RV32IMFC+irq)까지 FemtoRV의 모든 변형을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:56.206074Z",
      "issues": []
    },
