    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Software",
      "source_hash": 9057406967736462854,
      "context_hash": 3691991156787698826,
      "translation": "소프트웨어",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:15.234689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Time to [compile and install software](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software) on your SoC.",
      "source_hash": 3603793008650410490,
      "context_hash": 10989047661959245618,
      "translation": "이제 SoC에 [소프트웨어를 컴파일하고 설치할](https://github.com/BrunoLevy/learn-fpga/tree/master/LiteX/software) 시간입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:15.234689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Compiling RiscV software for the device",
      "source_hash": 4850942898955939520,
      "context_hash": 17182552651241920981,
      "translation": "장치용 RiscV 소프트웨어 컴파일하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:15.234689Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "See LiteX demo [here](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex/tree/master/litex/soc/software/demo)",
      "source_hash": 6955047974420310931,
      "context_hash": 16308852349240735295,
      "translation": "LiteX 데모는 [여기](https://github.com/enjoy-digital/litex/tree/master/litex/soc/software/demo)를 참고하십시오",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:15.234690Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Sending software to the device",
      "source_hash": 16936200488349468669,
      "context_hash": 10906531748960837620,
      "translation": "장치로 소프트웨어 전송하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:54:15.234692Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "lxterm can be used to send a binary to the device, as follows:",
      "source_hash": 16562545097567264359,
      "context_hash": 15107439314464934666,
